Fix DIFR prefetch deadlock on display idle (screen never unblanks).

Upstream: https://github.com/NVIDIA/open-gpu-kernel-modules/pull/1286
Head commit: 937af596675ca8ee381db35750b581cac978b59f (fetched 2026-09-18, PR still open)
Tracks: https://github.com/NVIDIA/open-gpu-kernel-modules/issues/1289
Local:  workstation-config issue #3

Applied to the OS-agnostic nvidia-modeset layer only; see Dockerfile.

